## Bước 3: Định dạng CSS (`chat.css`)

Tạo file `static/css/chat.css` để định dạng các thẻ HTML ở trên, đặc biệt là phần bong bóng chat và thanh cuộn tàng hình.

```css
/* Widget tổng thể */
.chat-widget {
    position: fixed;
    bottom: 20px;
    right: 320px; /* Cách sidebar */
    width: 350px;
    height: 480px;
    background-color: #212534;
    border-radius: 16px;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    z-index: 1060;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.175, 0.885, 0.32, 1.275);
}

.chat-header {
    background-color: #2b3044;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
}

.chat-body {
    flex: 1;
    overflow-y: auto;
    padding: 16px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
}

/* Thanh cuộn tàng hình cho Chat Body */
.chat-body::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 6px; }
.chat-body::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: transparent; }
.chat-body::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border-radius: 10px; }
.chat-body::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2); }

.chat-footer {
    padding: 12px 16px;
    background-color: #2b3044;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
}

/* Ô nhập liệu */
.chat-input {
    background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
    border: none;
    border-radius: 20px;
    color: white;
    padding: 8px 16px;
    resize: none;
    overflow: hidden;
}
.chat-input:focus {
    background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    color: white;
    box-shadow: none;
}

/* Bong bóng chat */
.msg-bubble {
    max-width: 80%;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    border-radius: 18px;
    word-break: break-word;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
}

.msg-wrapper.me { flex-direction: row-reverse; }
.msg-wrapper.me .msg-bubble {
    background-color: var(--accent-color, #1db954);
    color: white;
    border-bottom-right-radius: 4px;
}

.msg-wrapper.other { flex-direction: row; }
.msg-wrapper.other .msg-bubble {
    background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    color: white;
    border-bottom-left-radius: 4px;
}

/* Hình ảnh và nhạc đính kèm */
.msg-image { max-width: 200px; border-radius: 12px; cursor: pointer; }
.msg-song-card {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
    padding: 8px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    margin-top: 5px;
    width: 220px;
}
.msg-song-card:hover { background: rgba(0,0,0,0.4); }
.msg-song-cover { width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 8px; object-fit: cover; }
```

